OL,3,GNEWSAFinal attempt to save disabled
OL,4,Aadults centre fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have been thwarted in a
OL,7,Flast ditch attempt to save a day centre
OL,8,Ffor adults with disabilities in
OL,9,FBrighton that was confirmed for closure
OL,10,Fearlier this month.
OL,12,FOn 17 September it was announced that
OL,13,FWellington House, which offers care to
OL,14,F21 people, would be shut to save
OL,15,F#336,000 a year.
OL,17,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,18,FReporting Service, an attempt to have
OL,19,Fthe closure decision called in by
OL,20,Fopposition councillors at Brighton &
OL,21,FHove City Council (BHCC) was
OL,22,Funsuccessful.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
