OL,3,GNEWSAFinal attempt to save disabled
OL,4,Aadults centre fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Greens and Conservatives told the
OL,7,FBHCC overview and scrutiny committee on
OL,8,FTuesday afternoon that there was
OL,9,Finsufficient evidence for the cabinet
OL,10,Fto make its decision, alongside a lack
OL,11,Fof stakeholder consultation.
